    "source_answer": "4.6 m",
    "previous_model_response": "The ground distance from the observation point to the lighthouse is \\(27\\) m, and the distance to the top is \\(37\\) m. Using the Pythagorean theorem:\n\n\\[\ny^2+27^2=37^2\n\\]\n\n\\[\ny=\\sqrt{37^2-27^2}\n=\\sqrt{1369-729}\n=\\sqrt{640}\n\\approx 25.3\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the height of the lighthouse is 25.3 m."
  },
  "answer_verification": {
