    "verified_answer": "4.6 m",
    "issue": "",
    "reasoning": "With horizontal distance 27, the two sightline distances 34 and 37 give heights sqrt(34^2-27^2) and sqrt(37^2-27^2). Their difference rounds to 4.6 m, matching the source."
